From 81627115a68eaeca4c6cf96cb980e91a16410308 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ahmed <ahmedmh03.work@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 04:02:45 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat(dashboard-api): send an Idempotency-Key when placing an
 order

A fresh key per order, reused if the same order is clicked again after no clear
answer. The button is disabled while the request is in flight. Built from
getRandomValues because crypto.randomUUID() needs https and dev is http.
---
 services/dashboard-api/static/index.html | 31 ++++++++++++++++++++----
 1 file changed, 26 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/services/dashboard-api/static/index.html b/services/dashboard-api/static/index.html
index cf329ac..0eb88b0 100644
--- a/services/dashboard-api/static/index.html
+++ b/services/dashboard-api/static/index.html
@@ -91,7 +91,7 @@
