Subject: [PATCH] feat(worker): email the customer when an order is cancelled

A cancelled order now gets an order_cancelled email, whatever the reason (abandoned,
declined, cancelled by hand), sent once per order. It is the last step of the cancel
handling and not best effort: if the email can't be sent the message goes back on the
queue, and the retry is safe because every earlier step can be repeated and the email
is de-duplicated. Adds the order_cancelled template to notification-service.
